lowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"mentioned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-09-25T20:58:10Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":31864956372,"node_id":"SE_lADOAgUK288AAAABTQXfQM8AAAAHa0yl1A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/31864956372","actor":{"login":"rjh-yext","id":59895513,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODk1NTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59895513?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext","html_url":"https://github.com/rjh-yext","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjh-yext/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-09-25T20:58:10Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5840338638","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/issues/73739#issuecomment-5840338638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73739","id":5840338638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAgUK288AAAABXBx-zg","user":{"login":"namanjain24-sudo","id":180642416,"node_id":"U_kgDOCsRicA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180642416?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain24-sudo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-25T22:08:45Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T22:08:45Z","body":"Confirmed on main (not just 3.3.1). To trace the exact path: `find_dag_file_paths` (`utils/file.py`) treats a `.zip` as a single Dag-processing unit — when `zipfile.is_zipfile(path)`, it appends the zip's own path to the file list rather than iterating its members. So `DagFileParseRequest.file` for a zipped Dag is the `.zip` file's real path, and in `check_dag_file_stability` (`dag_version_inflation_checker.py`), `Path(file_path).read_bytes()` successfully reads the zip's raw binary bytes, then `ast.parse(...)` raises `SyntaxError` on that binary content (confirmed empirically: `source code string cannot contain null bytes`) — caught by the same broad `except (SyntaxError, ValueError, TypeError, FileNotFoundError)`, so the check silently returns an empty result. `BundleDagBag` parses the Dags inside just fine, since it goes through the zip's own import machinery separately — only this stability check is blind to zip-packaged Dags.\n\nA fix would need `check_dag_file_stability` (or its caller in `processor.py::_parse_file`) to detect the zip case and iterate the archive's members (`zipfile.ZipFile(file_path).infolist()`, filtered the way `might_contain_dag` already filters elsewhere) and run the AST check per inner `.py` member instead of on the archive's own bytes.\n\n---\nDrafted-by: Claude Code (Sonnet 5); reviewed by @namanjain24-sudo before posting\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5840338638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"namanjain24-sudo","id":180642416,"node_id":"U_kgDOCsRicA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180642416?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain24-sudo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain2